{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月14日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16th Single 「愛MUST BE」\n本日発売日です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売日はCDショップに行きたくなります\n私も行こうかなーー…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛MUST BE\nhttps://youtu.be/G0NTHaW8eXw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自称バレエダンサー\nhttps://youtu.be/G0NTHaW8eXw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "元凶\nhttps://youtu.be/88-asxwFoI4"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ見ていただきたいです\n新しいミュージックビデオが完成するたびに\nやっぱり櫻坂が好きだなあって思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/moboMMzos.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobSk3xq2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケット写真のオフショット\n優が撮ってくれた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobc8jvmK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツーショットも撮った\n久々~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はクールな感じのメイクだったから\nカラコンつけてみた\n久しぶりだったので目がゴロゴロしてました…\nまたライブとかでつけたいですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobTryhNr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobt7zN39.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ撮影でも\n何枚かツーショット撮れました !"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浅井ちゃん初めてかも。\n嬉しいなーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobstcsZe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いっ\n大園さんはいつだって可愛い !"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週は歌番組にも\nたくさん出演させていただくので\n是非ご覧ください\n16th Singleも楽しみましょうね ⭐︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}